  <!-- ========================= ROUTE ========================= -->
  <section class="section section--tight" id="route">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">The night line</span>
          <h2 class="h2">One night,<br>four worlds</h2>
          <p class="lead">The dune crossing is not a gap between two places — it is the journey itself. Four landscapes, one sleeper train, and the slow change of light.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ol class="route reveal">
        <li class="stop">
          <span class="stop__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p class="stop__time">21:40</p>
          <h3>Salt Flats</h3>
          <p>Boarding under sodium lamps. Blankets, coffee, the whistle and a platform of sleepers.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="stop">
          <span class="stop__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p class="stop__time">01:15</p>
          <h3>Ashfall Dunes</h3>
          <p>The lights dim to ember. The desert takes the train, and every window becomes a planet.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="stop">
          <span class="stop__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p class="stop__time">09:40</p>
          <h3>Cinder Pass</h3>
          <p>Sunrise over black glass mountains. The whole carriage falls quiet without a word.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="stop">
          <span class="stop__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p class="stop__time">14:00</p>
          <h3>Neon City</h3>
          <p>Platform One. Steam, rain on hot asphalt, and a skyline that never turned it off.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================= FEATURES ========================= -->
  <section class="section" id="comfort">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Why the night train</span>
          <h2 class="h2">Built for<br>the in-between</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">Three things we refused to compromise on: where you lie, what you eat at 3 a.m., and how you arrive.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="features">
        <article class="feature reveal">
          <span class="feature__num">01</span>
          <span class="feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="7" y="8" width="34" height="31" rx="5"/>
              <path d="M7 25c7-4 11 3 17 0s11-4 17-1"/>
              <path d="M24 8v31"/>
              <path d="M13 15h5"/>
              <circle cx="35" cy="34" r="2.4"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3 class="h3">Every window faces the desert</h3>
          <p>Cabins sit on the outer wall of the train, so the dunes roll past at eye level and the sunrise arrives in your room — curtain still drawn.</p>
          <span class="feature__tag">Outward-facing berths</span>
        </article>

        <article class="feature reveal">
          <span class="feature__num">02</span>
          <span class="feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M19 12h10M24 12V7"/>
              <path d="M16 12l-3 8v15a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h14a4 4 0 0 0 4-4V20l-3-8"/>
              <path d="M13 24h22"/>
              <path d="M24 32c3 0 4-2 4-4 0 4-4 3-4 8 0-2-4-4-4-8 0 2 1 4 4 4z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3 class="h3">The Lantern Car never closes</h3>
          <p>Broth at 3 a.m., coffee at six, cardamom buns at seven. The kitchen runs the whole length of the night, and the steward remembers your order.</p>
          <span class="feature__tag">Open 24 hours</span>
        </article>

        <article class="feature reveal">
          <span class="feature__num">03</span>
          <span class="feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M8 41V24a16 16 0 0 1 32 0v17"/>
              <path d="M3 41h42"/>
              <path d="M19 41V30h10v11"/>
              <path d="M24 12v5M14 17l3 3M34 17l-3 3"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3 class="h3">You arrive, not just disembark</h3>
          <p>A hot shower, a pressed shirt and a quiet lounge wait at Platform One — breakfast, a phone to borrow, and the city at its gentlest.</p>
          <span class="feature__tag">Arrival lounge included</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

